 British designer Suzanne Neville.<br \/>\nThe invitations had a bespoke floral design and were laser cut to give the impression of lace while the 7 tier wedding cake had embellishments and lace similar to those on the dress.<br \/>\nThe venue was choc full of blooms from mix of tall and shorter table arrangements on clear glass vases and gorgeous ceiling hung wreaths. Not only were the flowers visually stunning but their scent is something I will never forget. I kid you not, I could smell the flowers before I entered the marquee!<br \/>\nBut enough of my ramblings I\u2019ll let the details speak for themselves all beautifully captured by Marc Smith Photography.<\/p>\n<\/div><div class=\"awb-gallery-wrapper awb-gallery-wrapper-1 button-span-no\"><div style=\"margin:-5px;--awb-bordersize:0px;\" class=\"fusion-gallery fusion-gallery-container fusion-grid-3 fusion-columns-total-18 fusion-gallery-layout-grid fusion-gallery-1\"><div style=\"padding:5px;\" class=\"fusion-grid-column fusion-gallery-column fusion-gallery-column-3 hover-type-none\"><div class=\"fusion-gallery-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/06\/TC-84.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\" data-rel=\"iLightbox[gallery_image_1]\" class=\"fusion-lightbox\" target=\"_self\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/06\/TC-84-460x295.jpg\" width=\"460\" height=\"295\" alt=\"\" title=\"T&amp;C-84\" aria-label=\"T&amp;C-84\" class=\"img-responsive wp-image-602 fusion-gallery-image-size-fixed\"  \/><\/a><\/div><\/div><div style=\"padding:5px;\" class=\"fusion-grid-column fusion-gallery-column fusion-gallery-column-3 hover-type-none\"><div class=\"fusion-gallery-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/06\/TC-161-2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\" data-rel=\"iLightbox[gallery_image_1]\" class=\"fusion-lightbox\" target=\"_self\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/06\/TC-1